ities. She is no longer a virgin, and she has been partying with you all day and night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are suppressing the powerful magic of &quot;Reese&quot;, you are also helping the goddess &quot;Laler&quot; to solve her high-intensity sexual desire. Miss &quot;Shirley&quot; invites you to escape with her? Perhaps the village will be like what &quot;Shirley&quot; said... it's only a matter of time before it falls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith and desire, freedom and responsibility, the love and lust between you and the three girls are interwoven into a huge and complex web of fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172230/extras/6f7c8c72130de48ff8340107ecc91eaa.poster.avif?t=1753773452\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172230/extras/6f7c8c72130de48ff8340107ecc91eaa.webm?t=1753773452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172230/extras/6f7c8c72130de48ff8340107ecc91eaa.mp4?t=1753773452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8bGame Features\ud83d\udc8b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock by eliminating: Unlock exquisite CG by eliminating three blocks, bringing you a beautiful visual enjoyment. \ud83d\udc9d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character and torn clothes system: Click on the character's character to interact, and add torn clothes/sexy props when attacking\ud83d\udc9d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple heroines: Focus on shaping three female characters with different personalities, the game text is 20,000 words, and each character has an ending. \ud83d\udc9d</strong></p></li